{
  "schemaVersion": 2,
  "id": "@forgeax-plugin/wb-scene-generator",
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "displayName": {
    "zh": "场景生成器",
    "en": "Scene Generator"
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": "以 Scene Script 为创作真值、节点图为同步可视化投影的场景设计工作台",
    "en": "A scene-design workbench with Scene Script as authoring truth and the node graph as its synchronized visual projection"
  },
  "icon": "🌍",
  "compatibleWith": {
    "forgeax-node-runtime": "^0.3.0"
  },
  "requestedEnv": [
    "FORGEAX_PLUGIN_DEV_PORTS_FILE",
    "FORGEAX_SCENE_BACKEND_URL",
    "FORGEAX_SCENE_SCREENSHOT_NO_VISION",
    "FORGEAX_ASSET2D_BACKEND_URL",
    "FORGEAX_PROJECT_ROOT",
    "AW_SUPPORT_RUNS_DIR"
  ],
  "entry": {
    "frontend": "./frontend/dist/index.html",
    "backend": "./backend/src/tool-handlers.ts",
    "standalone": {
      "start": "pnpm serve",
      "port": 9555,
      "readyProbe": "/",
      "embeddedAlso": false
    }
  },
  "experimental": true,
  "categories": [
    "workbench"
  ],
  "contributes": {
    "panelTypes": [
      {
        "id": "wb-scene-generator.content",
        "runtime": "iframe",
        "entry": "./frontend/dist/index.html"
      }
    ],
    "pages": [
      {
        "id": "wb-scene-generator",
        "title": {
          "zh": "场景生成器",
          "en": "Scene Generator"
        },
        "icon": "🌍",
        "cardinality": "singleton",
        "restorePolicy": "project",
        "layout": {
          "version": 2,
          "root": {
            "kind": "split",
            "direction": "horizontal",
            "sizes": [
              280,
              840
            ],
            "children": [
              {
                "kind": "tabs",
                "placements": [
                  "sidebar"
                ],
                "active": "sidebar"
              },
              {
                "kind": "tabs",
                "placements": [
                  "workspace"
                ],
                "active": "workspace"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "layoutVersion": 2,
        "panels": [
          {
            "id": "sidebar",
            "panelType": {
              "extension": "self",
              "id": "wb-scene-generator.content"
            },
            "initialProps": {
              "pane": "left",
              "minWidth": 280,
              "scrollable": true
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "workspace",
            "panelType": {
              "extension": "self",
              "id": "wb-scene-generator.content"
            },
            "initialProps": {
              "pane": "center",
              "minHeight": 600,
              "scrollable": false
            }
          }
        ],
        "matchProduces": [
          "**/scene/**/*.scene.ts",
          "**/scene-model.json",
          "**/scenes/**.scene.json"
        ],
        "preferredAgent": "@forgeax-extension/agent-sino"
      }
    ],
    "activities": [
      {
        "id": "wb-scene-generator.launcher",
        "title": {
          "zh": "场景生成器",
          "en": "Scene Generator"
        },
        "icon": "🌍",
        "category": "workbench",
        "pageType": {
          "extension": "self",
          "id": "wb-scene-generator"
        }
      }
    ],
    "skills": [
      {
        "id": "wb-scene-generator:author-guide",
        "entry": "./SKILL.md",
        "trigger": "/wb-scene-generator"
      },
      {
        "id": "compose-scene-script",
        "entry": "./skills/compose-scene-script/SKILL.md",
        "trigger": "/compose-scene-script"
      }
    ],
    "tools": [
      {
        "id": "scene:projects.list",
        "args": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "returns": {
          "type": "array"
        },
        "exposedToAI": true,
        "description": {
          "zh": "列出 Scene Generator 项目",
          "en": "List Scene Generator projects"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene:projects.create",
        "args": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "name"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "name": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "type": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "description": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "fromTemplate": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "returns": {
          "type": "object"
        },
        "exposedToAI": true,
        "description": {
          "zh": "创建 Scene Generator 项目",
          "en": "Create a Scene Generator project"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene:projects.open",
        "args": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "id"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "id": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "returns": {
          "type": "object"
        },
        "exposedToAI": true,
        "description": {
          "zh": "打开指定 Scene Project 并建立当前 Sino 会话上下文；实际写入由 Scene Script 事务获取独占锁。",
          "en": "Open a Scene Project for the current Sino session; Scene Script transactions acquire the exclusive write lock when needed."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene:projects.close",
        "args": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "id"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "id": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "returns": {
          "type": "object"
        },
        "exposedToAI": true,
        "description": {
          "zh": "关闭/释放对指定 Scene Generator 项目的独占锁；释放后才能打开另一个项目。释放后锁会立刻移交给排队队列里的下一个 agent（如果有的话）。",
          "en": "Close/release the exclusive lock on a Scene Generator project; required before opening another. On release the lock is handed immediately to the next agent in that project's wait queue, if any."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene:projects.heartbeat",
        "args": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "id"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "id": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "returns": {
          "type": "object"
        },
        "exposedToAI": false,
        "description": {
          "zh": "续期当前会话已持有的 Scene Project 写入锁；正常 Scene Script 事务会自动续期。",
          "en": "Renew the current session's Scene Project write lease; normal Scene Script transactions renew it automatically."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene:projects.queue.status",
        "args": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "id"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "id": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "returns": {
          "type": "object"
        },
        "exposedToAI": false,
        "description": {
          "zh": "查询指定项目当前的排队情况（FIFO，position=1 表示下一个轮到）。只读，不会把你加入队列——加入队列要调用 scene:projects.open。",
          "en": "Inspect a project's current FIFO wait queue (position 1 = next in line). Read-only — does NOT join the queue; call scene:projects.open to do that."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene:projects.queue.leave",
        "args": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "id"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "id": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "returns": {
          "type": "object"
        },
        "exposedToAI": false,
        "description": {
          "zh": "主动退出指定项目的排队队列（例如你决定改去处理别的项目）。幂等；未排队时调用无副作用。",
          "en": "Voluntarily leave a project's wait queue (e.g. you decided to work on a different project instead). Idempotent; a no-op if you weren't queued."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene:projects.remove",
        "args": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "id"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "id": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "assetPolicy": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "detach",
                "delete"
              ]
            }
          },
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "returns": {
          "type": "object"
        },
        "exposedToAI": false,
        "requireConfirm": "destructive",
        "confirmMessage": {
          "zh": "删除 Scene Generator 项目需要确认",
          "en": "Deleting a Scene Generator project requires confirmation"
        },
        "description": {
          "zh": "删除指定 Scene Generator 项目",
          "en": "Remove a Scene Generator project"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene:script.contracts",
        "args": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "projectId": { "type": "string" }
          },
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "returns": { "type": "object" },
        "exposedToAI": true,
        "description": {
          "zh": "返回版本化 Scene Script 函数目录；模板与组只暴露公共端口和能力，不返回内部拓扑。",
          "en": "Return the versioned Scene Script function catalog without sealed group internals."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene:script.get",
        "args": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "projectId": { "type": "string" },
            "file": { "type": "string" }
          },
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "returns": { "type": "object" },
        "exposedToAI": true,
        "description": {
          "zh": "读取场景源码、源码修订号和 Source Map 状态。",
          "en": "Read Scene Script source, its revision, and source-map state."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene:script.validate",
        "args": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": ["source"],
          "properties": {
            "projectId": { "type": "string" },
            "file": { "type": "string" },
            "source": { "type": "string" }
          },
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "returns": { "type": "object" },
        "exposedToAI": true,
        "description": {
          "zh": "只解析、类型检查和编译 Scene Script，不修改项目。",
          "en": "Parse, type-check, and compile Scene Script without mutating the project."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene:script.put",
        "args": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": ["source"],
          "properties": {
            "projectId": { "type": "string" },
            "file": { "type": "string" },
            "source": { "type": "string" },
            "expectedRevision": { "type": "string" },
            "canonicalize": { "type": "boolean" },
            "label": { "type": "string" }
          },
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "returns": { "type": "object" },
        "exposedToAI": true,
        "description": {
          "zh": "以单次源码事务更新场景；成功后节点图、预览和 Source Map 同步刷新。",
          "en": "Commit one Scene Script transaction and refresh the projected graph, preview, and source map."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene:authoring.lens",
        "args": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "projectId": { "type": "string" },
            "file": { "type": "string" },
            "statementId": { "type": "string" },
            "entityId": { "type": "string" }
          },
          "anyOf": [
            { "required": ["statementId"] },
            { "required": ["entityId"] }
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "returns": { "type": "object" },
        "exposedToAI": false,
        "description": {
          "zh": "获取一个 Authoring Entity 及其一跳上下游、公共契约、允许动作和源码修订号。",
          "en": "Get a scoped edit lens with one-hop context, public contract, capabilities, and source revision."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene:authoring.applyCommands",
        "args": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": ["expectedRevision", "commands"],
          "properties": {
            "projectId": { "type": "string" },
            "file": { "type": "string" },
            "expectedRevision": { "type": "string" },
            "label": { "type": "string" },
            "commands": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": { "type": "object" }
            }
          },
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "returns": { "type": "object" },
        "exposedToAI": false,
        "description": {
          "zh": "对 Edit Lens 范围内的 Authoring Entity 应用结构化命令；Agent 无法修改密封模板/组内部拓扑。",
          "en": "Apply scoped Authoring Entity commands; sealed template/group internals are capability-protected."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene:agent.resumeSceneWork",
        "args": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "projectId": { "type": "string" }
          },
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "returns": { "type": "object" },
        "exposedToAI": true,
        "description": {
          "zh": "恢复当前 Scene Project 的有界工作上下文、checkpoint 和未完成事务。",
          "en": "Resume the bounded work context, checkpoint, and unfinished transaction for the current Scene Project."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene:agent.locateSceneTarget",
        "args": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "projectId": { "type": "string" },
            "query": { "type": "string" },
            "selection": { "type": "object" },
            "authoringId": { "type": "string" },
            "sceneNodeId": { "type": "string" },
            "path": { "type": "string" },
            "semanticAddress": { "type": "string" }
          },
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "returns": { "type": "object" },
        "exposedToAI": true,
        "description": {
          "zh": "按 UI 选择、稳定语义地址、Scene 节点/路径与查询证据排序定位目标；歧义时要求澄清。",
          "en": "Resolve scene targets from ranked selection, semantic-address, lineage, and query evidence; ambiguity requires clarification."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene:agent.openEditLens",
        "args": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": ["targetIds"],
          "properties": {
            "projectId": { "type": "string" },
            "targetIds": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "string" } },
            "radius": { "type": "number" },
            "concerns": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "string" } },
            "expansionReason": { "type": "string" }
          },
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "returns": { "type": "object" },
        "exposedToAI": true,
        "description": {
          "zh": "打开有界 Edit Lens；只含目标源码、一跳依赖/消费者、空间摘要、不变量和写范围，不返回完整 Runtime/DataTree。",
          "en": "Open a bounded edit lens without full Runtime Graph or DataTree payloads."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene:agent.proposeSceneEdit",
        "args": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": ["intent", "targetIds", "commands"],
          "properties": {
            "projectId": { "type": "string" },
            "intent": { "type": "string" },
            "targetIds": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "string" } },
            "writableModuleIds": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "string" } },
            "preconditions": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "object" } },
            "commands": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "object" } },
            "expectedSemanticDelta": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "object" } },
            "verificationProfile": { "type": "string", "enum": ["local", "global"] }
          },
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "returns": { "type": "object" },
        "exposedToAI": true,
        "description": {
          "zh": "创建持久、可回滚、带修订和写范围的 Scene Edit Transaction。",
          "en": "Create a persistent rollback-safe scoped Scene Edit Transaction."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene:agent.applySceneEdit",
        "args": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": ["transactionId"],
          "properties": {
            "projectId": { "type": "string" },
            "transactionId": { "type": "string" },
            "humanApproved": { "type": "boolean" }
          },
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "returns": { "type": "object" },
        "exposedToAI": true,
        "description": {
          "zh": "校验修订、scope、前置条件与 Human Gate 后应用事务；实际语义差异不符则回滚。",
          "en": "Apply after revision, scope, precondition, and human-gate checks; mismatched semantic delta rolls back."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene:agent.previewSemanticDiff",
        "args": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": ["transactionId"],
          "properties": {
            "projectId": { "type": "string" },
            "transactionId": { "type": "string" }
          },
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "returns": { "type": "object" },
        "exposedToAI": true,
        "description": {
          "zh": "预览有界 Semantic Diff 与直接修改、重编译、重执行、重验证、未变化影响分类。",
          "en": "Preview bounded semantic diff and impact classifications."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene:agent.verifySceneEdit",
        "args": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": ["transactionId", "profile"],
          "properties": {
            "projectId": { "type": "string" },
            "transactionId": { "type": "string" },
            "profile": { "type": "string", "enum": ["local", "global"] }
          },
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "returns": { "type": "object" },
        "exposedToAI": true,
        "description": {
          "zh": "运行 local/global Verifier 与只读 Critic；冻结标准不可降低。",
          "en": "Run local/global verification and a read-only Critic without weakening frozen standards."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene:agent.acceptOrRevertSceneEdit",
        "args": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": ["transactionId", "decision"],
          "properties": {
            "projectId": { "type": "string" },
            "transactionId": { "type": "string" },
            "decision": { "type": "string", "enum": ["accept", "revert"] }
          },
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "returns": { "type": "object" },
        "exposedToAI": true,
        "description": {
          "zh": "接受已验证预览，或原子回滚预览事务。",
          "en": "Accept a verified preview or atomically revert it."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene:batteries.list",
        "args": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "returns": {
          "type": "array"
        },
        "exposedToAI": false,
        "description": {
          "zh": "【人类/Workbench】列出全部 scene 电池（~300 ops）。不向 AI 暴露。",
          "en": "Human/workbench: full scene battery catalog (~300 ops). Not exposed to AI."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene:batteries.get",
        "args": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "id"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "id": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "returns": {
          "type": "object"
        },
        "exposedToAI": false,
        "description": {
          "zh": "【Workbench】读取任意 scene 电池定义。",
          "en": "Workbench access to an individual scene battery specification."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene:pipeline.get",
        "args": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "projectId": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "目标 scene 项目 id；省略时使用 agent 已 open 的项目或 UI 当前 viewing 项目 / target scene project id; when omitted uses the agent's open project or the UI viewing project"
            },
            "raw": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "description": "true=返回完整 graph（含 params，体积大，仅 debug）；默认 false=轻量摘要 / true=full graph with params (large, debug only); default false=summary"
            },
            "mode": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "hash",
                "summary"
              ],
              "description": "AI 默认 hash=仅 hash+节点/边计数；传 groupId/nodeIds/nameContains/opIdIn 时返回局部拓扑。summary=非筛选全图摘要，仅排障时使用 / AI defaults to hash; selectors return local topology. summary is full graph summary for diagnosis only."
            },
            "groupId": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "只返回该组及其邻接边（instantiate 后核对用）/ scope to group neighborhood after instantiate"
            },
            "nodeIds": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "description": "只返回这些 node 及其邻接边 / scope to listed nodes and their edges"
            },
            "nameContains": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "grep 式模糊过滤：按节点 name **或 id** 子串（大小写不敏感）匹配。instantiate 的组常共用电池名（如 PlaceOneDecoration），应用 id 前缀查（如 p1d_）。命中节点+邻接边，附 search.matchCount（0 命中时 nodes=[]，不回退全图）。可与 groupId/nodeIds 并集。 / Fuzzy filter on node name OR id (case-insensitive). Instantiated groups often share a battery name — search by groupId prefix (e.g. p1d_). Returns matches + adjacent edges and search.matchCount (0 → empty, never full-graph fallback)."
            },
            "opIdIn": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "description": "2026-07-15 新增：按 opId 精确匹配任意一个（如 [\"tree_merge\"] 找所有 tree_merge 节点），行为同 nameContains（命中+邻接边，附带 search.matchCount）。 / 2026-07-15: exact match against any of the given opIds (e.g. [\"tree_merge\"] finds every tree_merge node); same behavior as nameContains (matches + adjacent edges, plus search.matchCount)."
            }
          },
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "returns": {
          "type": [
            "object",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "exposedToAI": false,
        "description": {
          "zh": "【Workbench/调试】读取 Runtime Graph 摘要或局部投影；Scene Script Agent 不使用。",
          "en": "Workbench/debug access to Runtime Graph summaries or local projections; not used by the Scene Script Agent."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene:pipeline.execute",
        "args": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "projectId": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "目标 scene 项目 id；AI 须先 scene:projects.open / target project id; AI must scene:projects.open first"
            },
            "nodeId": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "mode": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "summary"
              ],
              "description": "AI 默认只返回 verification；summary 返回已有的详细轻量执行摘要，仅在验证失败后用于诊断。"
            }
          },
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "returns": {
